| 2026-09-11 | **Node Runtime offline behavior** | TTL + heartbeat lease between Kernel and Node Runtime; in-flight capability calls are checkpointed and resumable on reconnect (durable execution pattern), not aborted. See [§11 — Node Offline Behavior](#node-offline-behavior). |
| 2026-09-11 | **Cost Tracker enforcement point** | The Space Kernel's **Admission Control**, not the Worker or Orchestrator, checks every `CapabilityRequest` against remaining budget before dispatch. Three modes: `hard_stop`, `approval_required`, `degraded`. See [§4 — Admission Control](#admission-control-budget-enforcement). |
